  "reviews": [
    {
      "author_name": "Jonn Gore",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114117082562893998156/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW4Fhz5_tJ_SPbRjt6xfd1WjNvaQ7kW7_YUvC2YDFBJ1GSr8iIw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "a week ago",
      "text": "What a gem! This was our first time trying here, we were not disappointed. Service was excellent, establishment was very clean and the food was delicious! We will be back again soon to try more items on the menu! Spicy pig ears on the appetizer menu were so yummy!",
      "time": 1750461091,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Scott W. Lee",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114456158829894236627/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLt8Jwl4zp41RU13AnGdKCmuy4wfrOsSH35eJ1PNpyLhZH89bI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
      "text": "Great place to eat. The waitress is very friendly,  the food is very authentic, the place is relaxing and comfortable, and the price is reasonable. I had cucumber with garlic sauce, crispy fungus with picked pepper, pig intestine noodle soup, popcorn chicken",
      "time": 1746391790,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "YASUDHAR JONCHHE",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100135017175084772840/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWE9GAc2fkz_TaV11u6bgHgGNItHqcHBK0urVfB_ctC6VvuSdEc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
      "rating": 3,
      "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
      "text": "They are well known for soup dumplings. The food was really good and good service. If you love Chinese food, definitely check it out!",
      "time": 1748569534,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Misty",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112803113510233740581/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxoOgF40Pj92PjF4Uz-EbXXrPghj6vDLjgODMSKh7ZfvYpFIY1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
      "text": "Super happy we stopped here for our late lunch! We got their cucumber in garlic sauce appetizer, super delicious only a little spicy, we both got a drink (mango smoothie & virgin passion fruit mojito) absolutely delicious. Would definitely recommend the mojito. We got their mixed soup dumplings, super super good can’t go wrong with soup dumplings definitely recommend. Got their steamed chicken & mushroom gyoza & their Chongqing noodles. The gyoza were amazing, the noodles were pretty yummy, the broth was delicious.",
      "time": 1746135857,
      "translated": false
    },
    {
      "author_name": "Ada Alfaro",
      "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117583312782621359698/reviews",
      "language": "en",
      "original_language": "en",
      "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUA2IQ-bykFmdiMsrBASi1ipMtgozb6pyXFQumFApgXpPNNH34=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
      "rating": 5,
      "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
      "text": "Tried the spicy wontons, piggy buns, and soup dumplings at Q Noodles all were delicious! The wontons had a nice kick, the piggy buns were cute and tasty, and the soup dumplings were full of flavor. Great food and friendly service. I’ll be back!",
      "time": 1749573288,
      "translated": false
    }
  ],
